input.prompt:
Consolidate all search results into a single JSON array. Extract and merge unique operators from all search results. Format:

[
  {
    "name": "Operator Name",
    "website": "https://...",
    "category": "diving-snorkeling|island-hopping|food-tours|wellness-spa|adventure|transport",
    "description": "Brief description"
  }
]

Remove duplicates based on website URL. Return ONLY valid JSON array, no markdown, no commentary.

Search Results:
${search_diving.result}
${search_snorkeling.result}
${search_island_hopping.result}
${search_cooking.result}
${search_spa.result}
${search_adventure.result}
${search_transport.result}

Transform the crawled operator data into structured listing JSON. Each listing should include:

{
  "id": "001",
  "slug": "operator-name-lower",
  "name": "Full Operator Name",
  "category": "diving-snorkeling|island-hopping|food-tours|wellness-spa|adventure|transport",
  "description": "Full description from website",
  "short_description": "Brief 100-char description",
  "location": {
    "area": "chaweng|lamai|bophut|maenam|choeng-mon|big-buddha|taling-ngam|nathon|lipa-noi|bang-por",
    "address": "Full address",
    "coordinates": { "lat": 9.5, "lng": 100.0 }
  },
  "itinerary": {
    "duration": "Full Day",
    "highlights": ["highlight1", "highlight2"],
    "schedule": "Pickup times, duration",
    "inclusions": ["item1", "item2"],
    "exclusions": ["item1", "item2"]
  },
  "pricing": {
    "adult": 1000,
    "child": 500,
    "currency": "THB"
  },
  "owner": {
    "name": "Owner/Contact name",
    "company": "Company name",
    "verified": false
  },
  "contact": {
    "phone": "+66...",
    "email": "email@example.com",
    "website": "https://...",
    "line_id": "line_id"
  },
  "media": {
    "hero_image": "/images/listings/slug-hero.jpg",
    "gallery": []
  },
  "reviews": {
    "rating": 4.5,
    "count": 100
  },
  "tags": ["tag1", "tag2"],
  "status": "draft"
}

Return ONLY valid JSON array of listings. No markdown, no commentary.

Crawled Data:
${crawl_operators.result}

Generate metadata for the listings JSON. Return JSON object:

{
  "total": <count of listings>,
  "categories": [<unique categories>],
  "areas": [<unique areas>],
  "last_updated": "<ISO date>",
  "version": "1.0",
  "pricing_ranges": {
    "diving-snorkeling": { "min": 1500, "max": 5000, "currency": "THB" },
    "island-hopping": { "min": 1200, "max": 3500, "currency": "THB" },
    "food-tours": { "min": 1200, "max": 2500, "currency": "THB" },
    "wellness-spa": { "min": 500, "max": 5000, "currency": "THB" },
    "adventure": { "min": 1500, "max": 5000, "currency": "THB" },
    "transport": { "min": 500, "max": 2000, "currency": "THB" }
  }
}

Listings:
${process_listings.result}
